From dab49e5d5d9c8d3bd7a90187208a8ceec7fec2b3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Takuro Ashie <ashie@clear-code.com>
Date: Fri, 14 Aug 2026 13:19:10 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 21/21] ozone/wayland: add Panfrost NV12 no-scale overlay fixes

Keep the existing V4L2NoScaleOverlay path split from Panfrost-specific
stability fixes. Limit forced Viz promotion to no-scale/no-crop NV12,
allow Panfrost GBM imports of decoder dmabufs, and tighten Wayland
attach handling for NV12 overlay buffers.

Gate the Panfrost-specific behavior behind the V4L2NoScaleOverlay field
trial parameter panfrost_workarounds so Mali DDK can keep using the
base V4L2NoScaleOverlay path without the extra promotion and surface
lifetime changes.

Use with --enable-features=V4L2NoScaleOverlay:panfrost_workarounds/true
on affected Panfrost configurations.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [RZ/G2L Panfrost/Weston NV12 overlay workaround]
